{{- define "review_round.user" -}}
## Acceptance Authority

Later approved decisions override {{ .AcceptanceSource }}: the roadmap's out-of-scope list, the user's recorded answers, and the {{ .GateLabel }} decisions file. Where one of them conflicts with an acceptance criterion, judge against the later decision. Do not raise again a finding the decisions file records as accepted as is.
