## Round Scope: Follow-Up

This round narrows the scope above. You requested changes in iteration {{ .Since }}; review only whether those findings are resolved and what the fixes changed.

- Your open findings: {{ .PriorFeedbackPath }}
{{ template "review_round_delta" . }}
Report each open finding as resolved or still open. Raise a new finding only for a problem the fix delta introduced on your axis, and leave code outside the delta alone.{{ if .LiveRun }} Rerun the checks behind your open findings on the current commit.{{ end }}
{{ else if eq .Mode "confirm" }}
## Round Scope: Confirmation

This round narrows the scope above. You approved in iteration {{ .Since }} ({{ .PriorFeedbackPath }}), and fixes landed after that approval. Confirm it once against the cumulative fix delta.

{{ template "review_round_delta" . }}
Your approval stands unless the delta introduced a problem on your axis; request changes only for such a regression.{{ if .LiveRun }} Rerun the checks you ran for that approval on the current commit.{{ end }}
{{ end }}
